## ComponentOptions

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Options`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Core`

### Purpose
Configuration class for UI components, particularly settings pages. Tracks which Blazor components should render as settings tabs/panels, with support for section grouping and display ordering.

### Class Definition

```csharp
public class ComponentOptions
{
    public ComponentOptions()
    {
        SettingsComponents = new List<ComponentMetaData>();
        MenuOptions = new MenuConfig();
        FileSystemOptions = new FileSystemConfig();
    }

    internal List<ComponentMetaData> SettingsComponents { get; set; }

    public ComponentMetaData[] GetSettingsComponents()
    {
        return SettingsComponents.ToArray();
    }

    public MenuConfig MenuOptions { get; set; }
    public FileSystemConfig FileSystemOptions { get; set; }

    public static string OllamaDefaultEndpoint { get; set; } = "http://localhost:11434";
    public static bool IsServer { get; set; } = true;

    public class MenuConfig
    {
        public string ConverseUrl { get; set; } = "converse/{Id}";
        public bool AllowNewTab { get; set; } = true;

        public string GetConverseUrl(string id)
        {
            return ConverseUrl.Replace("{Id}", id);
        }
    }

    public class FileSystemConfig
    {
        public bool ExploreFolder { get; set; } = true;
    }
}

public record ComponentMetaData(Type Component, string? Section, int Order);
```

### Properties

| Property | Type | Access | Description |
|----------|------|--------|-------------|
| `SettingsComponents` | `List<ComponentMetaData>` | `internal` | Internal collection of registered settings components |
| `MenuOptions` | `MenuConfig` | public | URL template + new-tab settings (initialised in ctor) |
| `FileSystemOptions` | `FileSystemConfig` | public | File-explorer UI settings (initialised in ctor) |
| `OllamaDefaultEndpoint` | `string` | public static | Default `"http://localhost:11434"` — **not registered via DI** |
| `IsServer` | `bool` | public static | Default `true` — **not registered via DI** |

### Methods

#### `GetSettingsComponents()`
```csharp
public ComponentMetaData[] GetSettingsComponents();
```
Returns all registered settings components as an array. Used by the settings UI to render tabs/panels.

